[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4231070977","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118444#issuecomment-4231070977","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118444","id":4231070977,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78MQUB","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-12T08:21:30Z","updated_at":"2026-04-12T08:21:30Z","body":"For some context, see also:\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/73896","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4231070977/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4231166033","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118444#issuecomment-4231166033","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118444","id":4231166033,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78MnhR","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-12T09:00:46Z","updated_at":"2026-04-12T09:09:04Z","body":"See also:\r\n\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/10098\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/10553\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/93885\r\n\r\nI agree that we need to be careful with this, but note that for dictionary keys, the comparison should be something like the `is_same()` behavior, not the `==` operator. That is, different Freed Objects should be considered inequivalent.\r\n\r\nCurrent behavior:\r\n\r\n```\r\nstr(value)                    <null>  <Object#null>  <Freed Object>\r\nvar_to_str(value)             null    null           null\r\n\r\ntrue if value else false      false   false          false\r\ntrue if not value else false  true    true           true\r\nis_instance_valid(value)      false   false          false\r\n\r\nvalue == null                 true    true           true           <-- !!!\r\nvalue == object_null          true    true           true           <-- !!!\r\nvalue == freed_object         true    true           true (same)    <-- !!!\r\n                                                     true (other)   <-- !!!\r\n\r\nis_same(value, null)          true    false          false          <-- !!!\r\nis_same(value, object_null)   false   true           false          <-- !!!\r\nis_same(value, freed_object)  false   false          true (same)    <-- !!!\r\n                                                     false (other)  <-- !!!\r\n\r\ntypeof(value) == TYPE_NIL     true    false          false\r\ntypeof(value) == TYPE_OBJECT  false   true           true\r\nvalue is Object               false   false          Error\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4231166033/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4231188884","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118444#issuecomment-4231188884","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118444","id":4231188884,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78MtGU","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-12T09:14:38Z","updated_at":"2026-04-12T09:14:38Z","body":"... which brings up back to the problems of using mutable objects as dictionary keys in the first place.\r\n\r\nMaybe `Dictionary` should just use `is_same`?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4231188884/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4231237024","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118444#issuecomment-4231237024","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118444","id":4231237024,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78M42g","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-12T09:47:16Z","updated_at":"2026-04-12T09:47:16Z","body":"`is_same()` uses `identity_compare()`. Perhaps dictionary keys should use it instead of `hash_compare()`?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4231237024/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4231601179","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118444#issuecomment-4231601179","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118444","id":4231601179,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78ORwb","user":{"login":"Infiland","id":88491175,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NDkxMTc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88491175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland","html_url":"https://github.com/Infiland","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-12T13:28:40Z","updated_at":"2026-04-12T13:50:44Z","body":"Linux test is not passing, let me fix it...\r\nActually nvm, it's unrelated to my changes","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4231601179/reactions","tota